; EXPERIMENTAL MODULAR CORE: not a booted Android system.
; ONLY genuine AOSP 4.2 boot JARs + pinned DEX/index and
; native Symbian DEX/JNI/Binder broker. No old shim APK,
; framework-res, Launcher2, Settings or SystemUI in base.
; C: contains guest /system (read-only) and /data;
; /dev/binder is a virtual IPC endpoint, not disk storage.
; SAME SID as Java 0.2/v0.6; backup before installing.
# {"E63 AOSP Core DEX JNI Binder (no Android UI)"}, (0xE0B63E04), 0, 7, 0
